          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提供防休眠相關的海報視圖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick Menu": {
      "comment": "Feature title",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷菜单"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷菜單"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quickly switch different anti-sleep modes via status bar menu": {
      "comment": "Feature description",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过状态栏菜单快速切换不同的防休眠模式"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通過狀態欄菜單快速切換不同的防休眠模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重置"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重設"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset to Default Durations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复默认时长"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢復預設時長"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore the built-in anti-sleep durations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复内置防休眠时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢復內建防休眠時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set a specific duration, system restores sleep after time ends": {
      "comment": "Feature description",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置特定时长，结束后自动恢复系统休眠"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設置特定時長，結束後自動恢復系統休眠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings page: under Anti-Sleep Durations, the built-in durations, the add-custom field, and the reset button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置页：在「防睡眠时长」分组下，包含内置时长、添加自定义时长输入框和重置按钮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定頁：在「防睡眠時長」分組下，包含內建時長、新增自訂時長輸入框和重設按鈕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Indefinite duration keeps the system awake until you stop it manually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「永久」时长会一直保持系统唤醒，直到你手动停止。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「永久」時長會一直保持系統喚醒，直到你手動停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new duration appears in the list and is marked as a custom duration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新时长会出现在列表中，并标记为自定义时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新時長會出現在列表中，並標記為自訂時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of Anti-sleep: choosing a duration, switching between anti-sleep modes, and managing custom durations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手册介绍防休眠功能的界面与基本操作：选择时长、切换防休眠模式，以及管理自定义时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手冊介紹防休眠功能的介面與基本操作：選擇時長、切換防休眠模式，以及管理自訂時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To change the duration while anti-sleep is running, pick another duration; the timer restarts with the new value.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防休眠运行期间若要更改时长，直接选择其他时长，计时器会以新值重新开始。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防休眠執行期間若要變更時長，直接選擇其他時長，計時器會以新值重新開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ultra Lightweight": {
      "comment": "Feature title",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "极致轻量"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "極致輕量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstalling or disabling the plugin while anti-sleep is active releases the power assertion immediately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防休眠生效期间卸载或停用插件，会立即释放电源断言。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防休眠生效期間卸載或停用外掛，會立即釋放電源斷言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User Manual": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用手册"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用手冊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When anti-sleep is running, the system power assertion and the timer are released automatically at the end of the selected duration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防休眠运行期间，到所选时长结束时，系统电源断言与计时器会自动释放。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防休眠執行期間，到所選時長結束時，系統電源斷言與計時器會自動釋放。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.1"
}
